  "summary_text": "Falcon (payments migration)\nFalcon handed from Sam Patel to Tomás (Sam moves to Corvid SSO)\nRollback plan and schema migration and test fixtures\nRollback plan and communication plan seen as one underlying problem\nNotes on schema migration added to the doc\nTest fixtures is overdue for a cleanup\nTest fixtures is a little behind\nPreference to revisit it next cycle rather than split it into two pieces\nProgress updates\nDone: speed up the invoice export (Sam)\nDone: write the release checklist (Ruth)\nSlipped: write up the August outage review (Alex, now due Friday)\nReassigned: write the refund reconciliation job (Sam → Ruth)\nDone: run the Falcon dry run on staging (Tomás)\nNext steps\nAlex to draft the new on-call rotation by Thursday\nInês to get the Otter beta onto TestFlight by Thursday\nMegan to fix the Safari date picker bug by Friday",
  "summary_markdown": "### Falcon (payments migration)\n- Falcon handed from Sam Patel to Tomás (Sam moves to Corvid SSO)\n\n### Rollback plan and schema migration and test fixtures\n- Rollback plan and communication plan seen as one underlying problem\n- Notes on schema migration added to the doc\n- Test fixtures is overdue for a cleanup\n  - Test fixtures is a little behind\n- Preference to revisit it next cycle rather than split it into two pieces\n\n### Progress updates\n- **Done:** speed up the invoice export (Sam)\n- **Done:** write the release checklist (Ruth)\n- **Slipped:** write up the August outage review (Alex, now due Friday)\n- **Reassigned:** write the refund reconciliation job (Sam → Ruth)\n- **Done:** run the Falcon dry run on staging (Tomás)\n\n### Next steps\n- Alex to draft the new on-call rotation by **Thursday**\n- Inês to get the Otter beta onto TestFlight by **Thursday**\n- Megan to fix the Safari date picker bug by **Friday**",
  "private_notes_text": null,
  "private_notes_markdown": null,
