      "end_time": "2026-09-21T09:07:31.824000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "To be fair, on the payments migration, it's been quiet, honestly. To be fair, it's less about the on-call handoff and more about the feature flag cleanup and stuff. Which, the annoying thing about the dead letter queue is it's the blocker. Yeah no, we said we'd look at it with fresh eyes and then the retry logic happened",
      "start_time": "2026-09-21T09:07:31.872000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-21T09:07:51.539000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Oh, okay.",
