      "end_time": "2026-09-21T09:08:10.131000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "So",
      "start_time": "2026-09-21T09:08:10.871000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-21T09:08:11.471000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Look, it's funny, the test fixtures looked taking longer than expected over the the weekend and now I had more questions than answers. And then I'd rather do it properly than start with the boring version. And the spreadsheet came up after I mean, standup too, but yeah. Real quick, the payments migration is kind of the test test case for the original proposal. Plus when I looked at the dead letter queue for Falcon, it's mostly noise. Right, so we've been saying we'd loop in the other team for a while, or whatever.",
