      "end_time": "2026-09-21T09:09:15.574000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Kim"
      },
      "text": "So my main thing is the on-call rotation, should be done by Thursday.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-21T09:09:15.606000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-21T09:09:19.939000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "True.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-21T09:09:19.346000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-21T09:09:19.946000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "So yeah, the test fixtures is a little behind, but but the retry logic is a little fragile.",
